  "text": "How to protect your work boundaries and make client communication look completely professional every day. Replying to emails late at night forces you into stressful twenty-four-hour availability loops. Unrestricted communication schedules invite constant client interruptions, ruining your evenings and creating severe burnout. Draft your responses whenever inspiration strikes, then click Schedule Send to deliver during business hours. You establish firm professional boundaries without delaying project deliverables.",
